
### 1. Снапшоты до изменений
```sql
SELECT snapshot_id, committed_at, operation FROM lakekeeper.silver."customer$snapshots" ORDER BY committed_at
```
| snapshot_id | committed_at | operation |
|---|---|---|
| 2896680048948188630 | 2026-10-12 09:16:32.238 UTC | append |

### Исходное состояние
```sql
SELECT count(*) AS rows, count(DISTINCT nation_name) AS nations FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer
```
| rows | nations |
|---|---|
| 1500000 | 25 |

### 2a. Schema evolution: добавляем колонку
```sql
ALTER TABLE lakekeeper.silver.customer ADD COLUMN customer_tier varchar
```

### Старые строки не переписывались — новая колонка у них NULL
```sql
SELECT custkey, name, acctbal, customer_tier FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer ORDER BY custkey LIMIT 3
```
| custkey | name | acctbal | customer_tier |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Customer#000000001 | 711.56 | None |
| 2 | Customer#000000002 | 121.65 | None |
| 3 | Customer#000000003 | 7498.12 | None |

### 2b. Заполняем новую колонку (обогащение)
```sql
UPDATE lakekeeper.silver.customer SET customer_tier = CASE
            WHEN acctbal >= 5000 THEN 'GOLD'
            WHEN acctbal >= 0    THEN 'STANDARD'
            ELSE 'DEBTOR' END
```
-- затронуто строк: 1500000
```sql
SELECT customer_tier, count(*) AS customers FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer GROUP BY customer_tier ORDER BY 1
```
| customer_tier | customers |
|---|---|
| DEBTOR | 136384 |
| GOLD | 681126 |
| STANDARD | 682490 |

### 2c. Schema evolution: переименовываем колонку
```sql
ALTER TABLE lakekeeper.silver.customer RENAME COLUMN phone TO phone_number
```
```sql
SELECT custkey, phone_number, customer_tier FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer ORDER BY custkey LIMIT 3
```
| custkey | phone_number | customer_tier |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 25-989-741-2988 | STANDARD |
| 2 | 23-768-687-3665 | STANDARD |
| 3 | 11-719-748-3364 | GOLD |

### Снапшот ДО эволюции схемы по-прежнему читается
```sql
SELECT custkey, name, acctbal FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer FOR VERSION AS OF 2896680048948188630 ORDER BY custkey LIMIT 3
```
| custkey | name | acctbal |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Customer#000000001 | 711.56 |
| 2 | Customer#000000002 | 121.65 |
| 3 | Customer#000000003 | 7498.12 |

### Снапшоты после эволюции
```sql
SELECT snapshot_id, committed_at, operation, element_at(summary, 'added-records') AS added, element_at(summary, 'deleted-records') AS deleted FROM lakekeeper.silver."customer$snapshots" ORDER BY committed_at
```
| snapshot_id | committed_at | operation | added | deleted |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 2896680048948188630 | 2026-10-12 09:16:32.238 UTC | append | 1500000 | None |
| 1472664706081604478 | 2026-10-12 09:16:36.199 UTC | overwrite | 1500000 | None |

### 3. «Авария»: случайно удалили клиентов из RUSSIA
```sql
DELETE FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer WHERE nation_name = 'RUSSIA'
```
-- затронуто строк: 60065

### Текущее состояние после DELETE
```sql
SELECT count(*) AS rows, count_if(nation_name = 'RUSSIA') AS russia FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer
```
| rows | russia |
|---|---|
| 1439935 | 0 |

### 4. Time travel: читаем снапшот до аварии (1472664706081604478)
```sql
SELECT count(*) AS rows, count_if(nation_name = 'RUSSIA') AS russia FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer FOR VERSION AS OF 1472664706081604478
```
| rows | russia |
|---|---|
| 1500000 | 60065 |

### 5. Восстановление: откат таблицы к снапшоту до аварии
```sql
ALTER TABLE lakekeeper.silver.customer EXECUTE rollback_to_snapshot(1472664706081604478)
```

### После отката
```sql
SELECT count(*) AS rows, count_if(nation_name = 'RUSSIA') AS russia FROM lakekeeper.silver.customer
```
| rows | russia |
|---|---|
| 1500000 | 60065 |

### 6. Возвращаем имя phone (Gold-скрипты ссылаются на него); customer_tier оставляем как обогащение
```sql
ALTER TABLE lakekeeper.silver.customer RENAME COLUMN phone_number TO phone
```

### Итоговая схема
```sql
SELECT column_name, data_type FROM lakekeeper.information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = 'silver' AND table_name = 'customer' ORDER BY ordinal_position
```
| column_name | data_type |
|---|---|
| custkey | bigint |
| name | varchar |
| address | varchar |
| phone | varchar |
| acctbal | decimal(12,2) |
| mktsegment | varchar |
| comment | varchar |
| nationkey | bigint |
| nation_name | varchar |
| region_name | varchar |
| customer_tier | varchar |

